  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sanivation Regional Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sanivation partners with local governments to enable waste to be safely managed. To date, in Kenya, Sanivation has partnered with local governments to leverage &gt;$10M in infrastructure funding for sanitation, reach &gt;100,000 people, and created systemic change with national government through policy change and creation of national targets for city-wide inclusive sanitation. Sanivation is now using learnings from Kenya to expand (and respond to requests to expand) to new countries. Through this support, they will deliver on and derisk their developed regional expansion plan, growing their impact!</narrative>
  </description>
